{"id":379,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It’s rumored that this Pokémon was born deep underground in the planet’s mantle and that it emerged onto the surface 10,000 years ago."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Registeel’s body is made of a strange material that is flexible enough to stretch and shrink but also more durable than any metal."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Registeel was imprisoned by people in ancient times. The metal composing its body is thought to be a curious substance that is not of this earth."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Registeel has a body that is harder than any kind of metal. Its body is apparently hollow. No one has any idea what this Pokémon eats."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Its body is said to be harder than any kind of metal. A study has revealed that its body is hollow."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It is sturdier than any kind of metal. It hardened due to pressure underground over tens of thousands of years."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its body is harder than any other kind of metal. The body metal is composed of a mysterious substance. Not only is it hard, it shrinks and stretches flexibly."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Clear Body","hidden":false,"description":"Prevents other Pokémon's moves or Abilities from lowering the Pokémon's stats."},{"name":"Light Metal","hidden":true,"description":"Halves the Pokémon's weight."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":80,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"cave","color":"Gray","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":379,"name":"Registeel","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,232],[1,451],[6,523],[12,246],[18,23],[24,430],[24,442],[30,174],[36,133],[36,334],[42,359],[48,484],